{
  "id": "browser-html-namespace-reachability",
  "title": "WebExtension document reachability over-approximates HTML, SVG, and MathML parsing",
  "category": "browser-extension",
  "intent": "The document scanner deliberately does not model namespaces, raw text, CDATA, templates, script types, or self-closing syntax: every script-shaped reference in a reachable document — including linked XML documents, valid XML qualified names, inherited xml:base values, and decoded internal entity replacements — keeps full severity. Only a missed edge is a bug; invented edges are by design.",
